<title>USA: TABLE - IKON Office Solutions Inc Q3 net. [CORRECTED 15:57 GMT]</title>
<headline>TABLE - IKON Office Solutions Inc Q3 net. [CORRECTED 15:57 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY FORGE, Pa. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.19		    $0.30</p>
<p> Oper net		   30,128		   43,656</p>
<p> Revs		    1,316,306		1,059,125</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  133,552		  130,955</p>
<p>			Nine Months</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.56		    $0.82</p>
<p> Oper net		   89,402		  121,079</p>
<p> Revs		    3,734,600		2,975,065</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  134,669		  126,204</p>
<p>	    (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 operating net was $0.30/shr before $23 million of</p>
<p>transformation costs. First Call consensus was $0.30/shr.</p>
<p>(Corrects to show basis of First Call estimate)</p>
<p>1996 operating net excludes Q2 loss from discontinued</p>
<p>operations of $20.1 million, or $0.16/shr, and nine months profit</p>
<p>of $34.7 million, or $0.28/shr.</p>
<p>1997 nine months operating net excludes profit from</p>
<p>discontinued operations of $20.2 million, or $0.15/shr, and loss</p>
<p>on early debt payment of $12.2 million, or $0.09/shr.</p>
